flow down
title "Compaction decision"
subtitle "Decided top to bottom at the end of every turn. A is the active context, T the trigger threshold, P the packet size, k* the break-even turns. Idle return means cache cold and P < A"

decision idle "Tree idle"
decision cold "Idle return"
decision below "A < T"
decision payback "k* <= left"
box defer "Defer a turn" "Busy or mergeable input"
box fresh-idle "New session"
box stay-below "Continue"
box fresh-payback "New session"
box stay-payback "Continue"

idle -> cold "Yes"
cold -> below "No"
below -> payback "No"
idle -> defer "No"
cold -> fresh-idle "Yes"
below -> stay-below "Yes"
payback -> fresh-payback "Yes"
payback -> stay-payback "No"

step "Defer" "If the tree is not idle or an input can still merge, the decision waits for the next turn boundary"
  idle -> defer
step "Back after a long pause" "Past the cache lifetime with a packet smaller than the active context, the work moves to a new session"
  idle -> cold
  cold -> fresh-idle
step "Below the threshold" "If A is below T, the session continues as is"
  idle -> cold
  cold -> below
  below -> stay-below
step "Threshold reached" "It moves only when A is at least T and the break-even turns fit within the expected remaining turns"
  idle -> cold
  cold -> below
  below -> payback
  payback -> fresh-payback
